</script></head><body class="body"><div class="modal-container hail"><div class="modal-bg-image hail"></div><div class="modal-bg-color black"></div><div class="modal-content"><div class="div-block-19"><div data-w-id="6cff60f3-dac8-1ea3-8c3d-0ed919167c33" class="modal-close-container"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/620a904ff3dc0505eb97b7c2_SR_close.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="modal-close-button"/></div><div class="heading h3 align-left after-the-storm white-text">After the STORM</div><div class="heading h1 help-is-here margin-bottom-2rem">Help is Here.</div><p class="paragraph white-text modal-text margin-bottom-2rem">The recent hail storms in Oklahoma caused widespread damage to homes	and businesses - causing more than a golf-ball sized disruption to daily life.<br/></p><div class="heading h4 modal-subheader">Rapid Response, at-the-ready.</div><p class="paragraph white-text modal-text margin-bottom-2rem">Our Rapid Response team is ready to get to work repairing Oklahoma’s roofs - and do the job right, so your life can get back to normal.</p></div><div class="button-container"><a href="/contact" class="button large red mobile margin-right-1rem w-button">Contact Us</a><a href="tel:+14053506558" class="button large black mobile w-button"><strong>405.350.6558</strong></a></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/63446100df371183e5c9d735_SAL_RRT_900.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/63446100df371183e5c9d735_SAL_RRT_900-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/63446100df371183e5c9d735_SAL_RRT_900-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/63446100df371183e5c9d735_SAL_RRT_900.png 900w" alt="Rapid response" class="rapid-response-logo"/></div><div class="modal-container hide"><div class="modal-bg-image storm-clouds"></div><div class="modal-bg-color black"></div><div class="modal-content"><div class="div-block-19"><div data-w-id="7273764d-0bd7-49ca-7716-070b376f4a27" class="modal-close-container"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/620a904ff3dc0505eb97b7c2_SR_close.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="modal-close-button"/></div><div class="heading h3 align-left after-the-storm white-text">After the Storm</div><div class="heading h1 help-is-here margin-bottom-2rem">Help is Here.</div><p class="paragraph white-text modal-text margin-bottom-2rem">Hurricane Ian — one of the most powerful storms to hit the U.S. — has finally subsided. In its wake? An extensive trail of damage, and many of our Florida friends in need.<br/></p><div class="heading h4 modal-subheader">Rapid Response, at-the-ready.</div><p class="paragraph white-text modal-text margin-bottom-2rem">Our Rapid Response team is ready to get to work repairing Florida’s roofs — to do the job right, and do right by our neighbors.</p></div><div class="button-container"><a href="/contact" class="button large red mobile margin-right-1rem w-button">Contact Us</a><a href="tel:+18667226558" class="button large black mobile w-button"><strong>866.722.6558</strong></a></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/6344641e59b9f2325a09fca8_SAL_palmTrees_1920.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/6344641e59b9f2325a09fca8_SAL_palmTrees_1920-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/6344641e59b9f2325a09fca8_SAL_palmTrees_1920-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/6344641e59b9f2325a09fca8_SAL_palmTrees_1920-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/6344641e59b9f2325a09fca8_SAL_palmTrees_1920-p-1600.png 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/6344641e59b9f2325a09fca8_SAL_palmTrees_1920.png 1920w" alt="Palm Trees" class="palm-trees"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/63446100df371183e5c9d735_SAL_RRT_900.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/63446100df371183e5c9d735_SAL_RRT_900-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/63446100df371183e5c9d735_SAL_RRT_900-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/63446100df371183e5c9d735_SAL_RRT_900.png 900w" alt="Rapid Response" class="rapid-response-logo"/></div><div data-animation="default" class="navigation navbar w-nav" data-easing2="ease-out-cubic" data-easing="ease-in-cubic" data-collapse="medium" role="banner" data-no-scroll="1" data-duration="800" data-doc-height="1"><a href="/" aria-current="page" class="logo-link w-nav-brand w--current"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/603e8a675a07f0cd1b89022a_SR_whiteLogo.png" width="205" sizes="205px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/603e8a675a07f0cd1b89022a_SR_whiteLogo-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/603e8a675a07f0cd1b89022a_SR_whiteLogo.png 1114w" alt="Salazar Roofing Logo" class="logo-image"/></a><nav role="navigation" class="nav-items w-nav-menu"><div class="nav-link-container"><div class="nav-item-flex"><a href="/residential-roofing-contractors-okc" class="nav-link first-item w-nav-link">Residential</a></div><div class="nav-item-flex"><div data-hover="true" data-delay="0" data-w-id="3b4b9ff8-efaa-8bc5-1a5d-e3049d8e12af" class="dropdown w-dropdown"><div data-w-id="3b4b9ff8-efaa-8bc5-1a5d-e3049d8e12b0" class="dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><a href="/commercial-roofing-contractors-okc" class="nav-link first-item dropdown-nav-link w-nav-link">Commercial</a><div class="dropdown-icon w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div></div><nav class="dropdown-list-5 w-dropdown-list"><a href="/featured-projects-okc" class="nav-link first-item dropdown-list-link w-nav-link">Projects</a></nav></div></div><div class="nav-item-flex"><a href="/insurance" class="nav-link w-nav-link">Claims</a></div><div class="nav-item-flex"><a href="/about-us" class="nav-link w-nav-link">About Us</a></div><div class="nav-item-flex"><a href="/locations" class="nav-link last-item w-nav-link">Locations</a></div><div class="nav-item-flex mobile-only"><a href="/contact" class="button nav-contact-btn w-inline-block"><div class="nav-contact-text">Contact US</div></a></div><div class="mobile-nav-social mobile-only"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/SalazarRoofing/" class="nav-social-media navigation-item w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/603e963c049ea9df473844a2_facebook.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="nav-facebook"/></a><a href="https://www.facebook.com/SalazarRoofing/" class="nav-social-media navigation-item w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/603e97502defedf28e29c0a6_instagram.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="nav-instagram"/></a></div><div class="mobile-nav-line w-embed"><hr style="background-color: #E3E6E5; width: 100%; height: 2px; opacity: .3;"></div><a href="/" aria-current="page" class="mobile-logo-link w-inline-block w--current"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/603e8a675a07f0cd1b89022a_SR_whiteLogo.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1114px) 100vw, 1114px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/603e8a675a07f0cd1b89022a_SR_whiteLogo-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/603e8a675a07f0cd1b89022a_SR_whiteLogo.png 1114w" alt="Salazar Roofing Logo" class="mobile-logo"/></a></div></nav><div class="nav-contact-container"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/SalazarRoofing/" target="_blank" class="nav-social-media navigation-item w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/603e963c049ea9df