me-banner-quote author">– Cindy Barnett</span><br/><span class="home-stars"><strong class="bold-text">★★★★★</strong></span></div></div><a href="/contact" class="button large red home-banner-button w-button">Get Your No-Obligation Assessment</a><h1 class="white-text home-banner-title">Roof Repair <span class="block">and replacement in okc</span></h1><div class="licensure-container"><div class="licensure">OK #CE80000259 • CO # 22097 • FL # CCC1328320 • LA # 68698</div></div></div></div></div><section id="homeProven" class="section dark-shingles"><div class="container flexbox vertical center"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/603e7b319e469c325e1f7335/603fd05c83f74ddb6a12ab7b_SR_fav.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Salazar Roofing" class="image logo-icon"/><h2 class="gray-text mobile-padding-bottom-5vw">Trusted. <span class="white-text">Local.</span> Proven.</h2><p class="white-text align-center margin-bottom-3vw mobile-width-90 mobile-margin-bottom-5vw small-paragraph">We’ll treat you like family, it’s the only way we know. <span class="desktop-break">From the first visit to the last shingle, we’ll be there with you.</span></p><h2 class="mobile-width-75 h2">Proudly serving Oklahoma, Colorado, Louisiana, &amp; Florida</h2></div></section><section id="rwl-map" class="map-section"></section><div class="div-block-47"><section id="rwl-review-carousel" class="review-section"></section></div><section id="homeCounters" class="section home-counter"><div class="w-layout-grid _3-column-grid _3-row-grid"><div class="grid-item flexbox vertical center counter-item"><div class="counter">39,602,394</div><div class="red-line-long"></div><h3 class="number-counter-item">Shingles</h3></div><div class="grid-item flexbox vertical center counter-item"><div class="counter">199,207,432</div><div class="red-line-long"></div><h3 class="number-counter-item">Nails</h3></div><div class="grid-item flexbox vertical center"><div class="counter">24,877</div><div class="red-line-long"></div><h3 class="number-counter-item">Roofs</h3></div></div></section><section id="homeProblem" class="section light-gray-bg"><div class="flexbox-centre"><div id="w-node-_35a84103-69f8-7058-f682-519095b75aca-221f7342" class="flex-left"><h2 class="gray-text align-right mobile">Everything you need,<br/><span class="text-span-7"> Nothing you don&#x27;t.</span></h2></div><div class="flex-right border-left-gray shorten-text-right"><p class="paragraph-52">Roofing issues can be intimidating when you don’t know how to navigate the process. We partner with you throughout the project to ensure all your problems are addressed, without selling you stuff you don’t need. We take pride in treating people well and doing roofing the right way.</p></div></div></section><section id="homeCollage" class="section no-horizontal-padding no-vertical-padding light-gray-bg"><div class="w-layout-grid image-grid-1-2"><a id="w-node-_0941da32-bbd1-df61-1bf0-d93f2b5b399a-221f7342" data-w-id="0941da32-bbd1-df61-1bf0-d93f2b5b399a" href="/residential-roofing-contractors-okc" class="collage-outer-main w-inline-block"><div class="image-text collage-text-cushion-left collage-text-cushion-bottom"><h3 class="image-title-text-copy">Residential Roofing</h3></div><div class="collage-inner-wrapper"><div class="collage-inner home-collage-1"></div></div></a><a id="w-node-e6ef4cce-9d31-bae3-3ecf-5d583e8a2dbd-221f7342" data-w-id="e6ef4cce-9d31-bae3-3ecf-5d583e8a2dbd" href="/commercial-roofing-contractors-okc" class="collage-outer homepage-collage-outer w-inline-block"><div class="image-text collage-text-cusion-bottom collage-text-cushion-bottom"><h3 class="image-title-text-copy">Commercial Roofing</h3><div class="cta-collage-text-bottom hover-arrow">See our featured projects </div></div><div class="collage-inner-wrapper"><div class="collage-inner home-collage-2"></div></div></a><a id="w-node-_891fd49d-f2ed-42b0-1cfc-30b77fdfb66b-221f7342" data-w-id="891fd49d-f2ed-42b0-1cfc-30b77fdfb66b" href="/insurance" class="collage-outer ho